### 0.12.8 產物與命名（每 SET）

```
boundary_pedestrian_setX_*/grid*/
  cells_manifest.json     # core/box/ω/n
  1_cells/*.jpg
  2_hd/hd_assets.json
  3_out/FINAL_GRID{24|6}_* .jpg
  3_out/META_GRID*.json
SETO_GRID24_*_FINAL.jpg   # 或 SET 代號前綴
GRID_META 必含：L0_id, n, ω, S, method(A|B|C), confs, laps, L-sha12
```

